{"title":"2005 Cyprus Seniors TST/Day 1/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Cyprus_Seniors_TST/Day_1/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given a triangle with sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/b/7ebc9435cf037e230c3dea173d52a1c4a4172c10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha, \\beta, \\gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"16\" />. Prove that:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/5/6156c491a9cd30e6d73c7c8ad2c185b8986e317a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha^2 (\\beta+\\gamma-\\alpha)+\\beta^2 (\\gamma+\\alpha-\\beta)+\\gamma^2 (\\alpha+\\beta-\\gamma)\\leq 3 \\alpha \\beta \\gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"442\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Cyprus_Seniors_TST/Day_1/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/d/58d5112e08fe1756a668d9ff769d33d1557ae693.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha =y+z, \\beta =x+z, \\gamma =x+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"249\" height=\"18\" />. Then the inequality becomes\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/6/5e6ad39bebbfa86818ff62eb701f32723762f86b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x(y+z)^2+2y(x+z)^2+2z(x+y)^2 \\leq 3(x+y)(y+z)(z+x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"493\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>After expansion, it is equivalent to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/5/bd52b9aa10c744c5cef257ef47dfb5f335f7b012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2y+y^2x+x^2z+z^2x+y^2z+z^2y \\geq 6xyz$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"337\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Which is true by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6881c5aa54ff16ee44e9c045a7eb13c5dc303d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM-GM$\" width=\"89\" height=\"13\" /> inequality \n</p>\n<hr />\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Cyprus_Seniors_TST/Day_1/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 Cyprus Seniors TST/Day 1/Problem 1\">Previous Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Cyprus_Seniors_TST/Day_1/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 Cyprus Seniors TST/Day 1/Problem 3\">Next Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Cyprus_Seniors_TST/Day_1\" title=\"2005 Cyprus Seniors TST/Day 1\">Back to Exam</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Cyprus_Seniors_TST/Day_1/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Team_Selection_Tests\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Team Selection Tests\">Cyprus Seniors Team Selection Tests</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_TST_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors TST Problems and Solutions\">Cyprus Seniors TST Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018051116\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 41/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate ar